This implies a 14.70 %min-1 sorption rate. Such a sorption rate points to chemisorption as the possible
reaction mechanism [16,33]. Also from the plot there looked to be adsorption and desorption of nickel
ions on the chitosan-silica hybrid aerogel. The % nickel removal rises as contact time increases until
equilibrium is attained. Sixty min was achieved as the optimum sorption time for this study.

