Cytotoxicity Assessment of Heavy Metal Arsenic
(Arsenic Trioxide) Using Nigella sativa L.
(Black Cumin) as Test System
Ankita Pramanik1, Animesh Kumar Datta1*, Sudha Gupta2,
Sandipon Basu2, Debadrito Das3 and Bapi Ghosh4
