Discussion

Chitosan@DOTAGA can provide a new preventative and therapeutic strategy to combat heavy metal exposure
from foodstuff and water. Chitosan is naturally occurring and is extracted from crustacean shells and fungi chitins
with high purity, providing an innate biocompatibility. The re-acetylation and functionalization of chitosan with

